  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Addressing the Drivers and Causes of Migration-Related Vulnerabilities among Border Communities along the Trans-Gambia Transport Corridor</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The pilot initiative with strong potential for replicability, will mitigate migration challenges and improve the cross-border environment along the Senegambia bridge by enhancing border posts to pre-empt situations of vulnerability; strengthening capacity of border authorities; increasing awareness among women and youth of their rights; and strengthening skills and opportunities for women and youth.</narrative>
  </description>
